{"book":"genesis","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:01:11.440260001Z","verse":7,"ref":"genesis 43:7","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":43,"translation":"And they said, Asking the man asked ⟨concerning⟩ us and concerning our kindred, saying, Is your father still alive? Have you a brother? And we told him according to the mouth of these words. Could we know that he would say, Bring down ⟨את⟩ your brother?","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"And they said"},{"surface":"שאול","gloss":"asking"},{"surface":"שאל","gloss":"asked"},{"surface":"האיש","gloss":"the man"},{"surface":"לנו","gloss":"⟨concerning⟩ us"},{"surface":"ולמולדתנו","gloss":"and concerning our kindred"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"העוד","gloss":"still"},{"surface":"אביכם","gloss":"your father"},{"surface":"חי","gloss":"alive"},{"surface":"היש","gloss":"Is there"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"אח","gloss":"a brother"},{"surface":"ונגד","gloss":"And we told"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"him"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"according to"},{"surface":"פי","gloss":"the mouth of"},{"surface":"הדברים","gloss":"these words"},{"surface":"האלה","gloss":"these"},{"surface":"הידוע","gloss":"Could"},{"surface":"נדע","gloss":"we know"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"יאמר","gloss":"he would say"},{"surface":"הורידו","gloss":"Bring down"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your brother"},{"surface":"אחיכם","gloss":"your brother"}]}